        "description": "<p>Effect: Each use of this attack fills 1 Span of the the Clock named for this Attack, up to a maximum of 3 Spans. The user gains +1 DEF and SPDEF Stage and +10 RES per Span filled of this Clock.</p><p>This Clock empties when the user resolves @UUID[Compendium.ptr2e.core-moves.Item.mGsDKzPNQ42oalNp.Actions.spit-up]{Spit Up} or @UUID[Compendium.ptr2e.core-moves.Item.mGsDKzPNQ42oalNp.Actions.swallow]{Swallow} and it resets if the user leaves combat, gains @Affliction[fainted], or combat ends.</p>",
        "img": "systems/ptr2e/img/svg/normal_icon.svg",
        "predicate": []
      },
