        },
        "category": "status",
        "types": [
          "normal"
        ],
        "description": "<p>Effect: The user gains the following effects, based on the number of Spans filled by the Stockpile Clock:</p><ul><li>1 Span: @Tick[6]</li><li>2 Spans: @Tick[12]</li><li>3 Spans: @Tick[16] and @Tick[2 shield].</li></ul>",
